    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Underfunded",
      "description": "Envelopes that ran dry this month: the accrued money was spent past, and the shortfall was forgiven rather than carried as a deficit. The most actionable number on this dashboard - it is the month an envelope failed to cover what it was for. A balance can no longer go negative, so this, not a minus sign, is the warning.",
