      "description": "Carry-forward categories, worst first. Per period is the bill itself; Monthly is what it accrues at. Balance is the fund as of this month, and Months covered is how many months of accrual that balance represents - under 1 on a bill due soon is the thing to act on. A negative balance means you are behind.",
